      "verified_by": "a_memchr_span_within_remaining_input",
      "fine_trace_step": 4,
      "description": "Root cause. `fgets_from_mem()` uses the destination-buffer-derived `size` as the `memchr` search span without first clamping it to the remaining input extent `end - *position`. The patch fixes this exact obligation by inserting `if (size > end - *position) size = end - *position;` immediately before the call."
    },
